  <diagram name="Trang-1" id="byRPvJk3_16-BohOr6ev">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml daily_allocation_v1.0\ntitle F3 - Batching, Weighted-Greedy Allocation and Admin Quote Approval\n\n|Admin/Operator|\nstart\n:Configure 12:00 (VN) batching schedule, ETA, radius Dmax=20km,\\nweights HSD 50% / distance 30% / quantity 20% (total 100%);\n\n|System|\n:At 12:00 -&gt; create/find exactly ONE run per day;\n:Select SOs the server received &amp; approved BEFORE cutoff;\n:Snapshot SO, MLOR, post-promo price, schedule, stock, weights;\n:Sort orders by server receipt time ascending (tie -&gt; order code):\\nP1 -&gt; C1 -&gt; P2 -&gt; SHORT;\n:Build a shared tentative stock pool\\n(in-life, not locked, not yet Reserved);\n\npartition \&quot;Loop per ORDER\&quot; {\n  repeat :Take the next order;\n    partition \&quot;Loop per LINE (R = remaining shortfall)\&quot; {\n      repeat :Examine line, take batch-warehouse pairs of same SKU in the pool;\n        :Filter batch: in-life, not locked, valid warehouse + distance;\n        :Compute ETA (wait run + approve + pick + issue + buffer + transport);\n        if (Within Dmax &amp; ETA not past deadline &amp; L/SL &gt;= MLOR?) then (eligible)\n          :Score S = 0.5*fE + 0.3*fD + 0.2*fQ;\n          :Pick highest score (tie -&gt; earliest expiry, nearest, batch code);\n          :Take q = min(pool batch, R); reduce pool; R = R - q;\n        else (no eligible candidate)\n          :Mark line SHORT;\n          break\n        endif\n      repeat while (R &gt; 0?) is (still short)\n      -&gt;line filled;\n    }\n    if (All lines of the order filled?) then (filled)\n      :Keep stored quantity promotion (no re-check by small batch);\n      :Compute each batch shelf-life % at pricing point -&gt; apply HSD% on post-promo price;\n      :Store base price, two discounts, final price, batch/warehouse, version;\n    else (short)\n      :ROLLBACK the whole order - return ALL tentative quantity to the pool;\n    endif\n  repeat while (More orders?) is (yes)\n  -&gt;no more orders;\n}\n\n|System|\n:Aggregate filled/short plan + prices + reasons -&gt; submit to Admin;\n\n|Admin|\n:Check stock/lock/expiry/ETA/MLOR, version, per-part prices;\nif (Plan reasonable?) then (approve)\n  |System|\n  :Atomic commit: Reserve + lock quote + response deadline\\n(all succeed or all roll back);\n  :Send final quote to retailer (version, total, deadline);\\nSO = \&quot;Awaiting retailer confirmation\&quot;;\nelse (request recalculation)\n  |Admin|\n  :Enter reason, keep old version, recompute a new plan;\n  stop\nendif\n\n|System|\n:Hand over awaiting-confirmation SO + quote + reserved quantity to F4;\nstop\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Yo5CGvQcULzVl4uT6Ehl-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
